# Local agent/tool config and generated code-graph output. These are untracked,
# so a CI build from a fresh checkout never sees them — but a local
# `vsce package` would happily publish your absolute paths and an extracted
# copy of the source. Keep them out regardless of who is packaging.
.codex/**
.mcp.json
opencode.json
graphoxide-out/**
